    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This well located 4 bedroom detached residence, which was built in 2000, is located in a quiet cul de sac of only 8 houses, close to all the amenities that the busy tourist village of Waterville has to offer, it boasts of an excellent view of Ballinskelligs bay and Hogs Head in the distance, and the development has a large green area to the front of the property and ample parking. The site/garden extends to C. .16 Ha/ C .064 of an acre and has a small Shed to the rear, a conservatory & Utility were added to the property in 2006 and has the added convenience of 2 bedrooms on the ground floor, The property has been well looked after and is in excellent decorative order, its accommodation includes the following:-\r\nEntrance way:- 2.26 M X 1.08 M\r\nSitting Room 3.65 M X 6.43 M\r\nKitchen Dining 4.30 M X 2.91 M\r\nConservatory 2.97 M X 2.84 M\r\nUtility 1.90 M X 1.91 M\r\nBedroom 1 3.17 M X 2.84 M\r\nBathroom 1.89 M X 1.90 M\r\nBedroom 2 3.18 M X 3.07 M\r\nFirst Floor\r\nLanding Area 2.19 M X 1.08 M\r\nBedroom 3 3.84 M X 3.77 M\r\nEnsuite 1.43 M X 1.51 M\r\nBedroom 4 2.94 M X 3.77 M"
      },
